[66.3788, "o", "import SecurityChallenge\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[66.379286, "o", "> open SecurityChallenge\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> def verdict : AuditVerdict := .vulnerable\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
